This product is a consent-based archive bot for SimpleX groups. Nothing a
group member contributes is republished on the public archive unless that
member has explicitly opted in, either by a bot command or by asking her in
plain language and confirming when she asks back (consent-first).

HOW THE SIMPLEX CHAT CORE IS USED

  The `simplex-chat` npm package embeds the SimpleX Chat core IN-PROCESS as a
  native Node addon (`binding.gyp`, `node-addon-api`); `bot.run` loads it
  inside this application's own process. There is NO separate simplex-chat CLI
  daemon, no WebSocket transport to one, and no exposed SimpleX port. Earlier
  versions of this file described a CLI daemon; that was never how this
  application worked and the statement is withdrawn.

  Because the core is linked into this process rather than executed as a
  separate program, this application is distributed under the AGPL-3.0-or-later
  (see LICENSE), matching the licence of the core it links.

